    <div class="ac-faq-list">
      <div class="ac-faq-item">
        <h3>1. How many 60 lb bags of concrete are in a cubic yard?</h3>
        <p>It takes exactly <strong>60 bags of 60 lb concrete</strong> to make 1 cubic yard (27 cu ft ÷ 0.45 cu ft per bag = 60). Most contractors order <strong>66 bags</strong> per cubic yard to include a 10% buffer for uneven ground and mixer residue.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="ac-faq-item">
        <h3>2. How many 80 lb and 40 lb bags of concrete make a cubic yard?</h3>
        <p>One cubic yard equals <strong>45 bags of 80 lb concrete</strong> (0.60 cu ft each) or <strong>90 bags of 40 lb concrete</strong> (0.30 cu ft each) before waste. With a 10% jobsite overage, plan on 50 eighty-pound bags or 99 forty-pound bags per yard.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="ac-faq-item">
        <h3>3. Should I buy 60 lb or 80 lb concrete bags?</h3>
        <p>80 lb bags cost roughly 5%–10% less per cubic foot of concrete and require 25% fewer rips and pours than 60 lb bags, making them the standard choice for crews. However, for solo DIYers mixing by wheelbarrow or lifting into a waist-high electric mixer, 60 lb bags dramatically reduce back fatigue and speed up consistent pours.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="ac-faq-item">
        <h3>4. When is it cheaper to order a ready-mix concrete truck instead of bags?</h3>
        <p>The break-even point is usually around <strong>1.5 to 2.0 cubic yards</strong> (about 68 to 90 eighty-pound bags). Above 2 yards, ready-mix concrete costs roughly $150–$195 per yard plus a $75–$150 short-load fee—often similar to or cheaper than bags while arriving uniformly mixed in 20 minutes.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="ac-faq-item">
        <h3>5. How many bags of concrete come on a full pallet?</h3>
        <p>Standard US lumberyard and home-center pallets hold <strong>42 bags of 80 lb concrete</strong> (3,360 lbs), <strong>56 bags of 60 lb concrete</strong> (3,360 lbs), or <strong>80 bags of 40 lb concrete</strong> (3,200 lbs). Many stores offer a 10%–15% bulk pallet discount when buying full skids.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <p class="ac-disclaimer">
      Disclaimer: Bag counts and costs are material planning estimates based on standard ASTM C387 dry-mix yields. Verify footing depths, rebar schedules, and compressive strength (PSI) requirements against local US building codes before pouring structural slabs or piers.
    </p>
  </section>

  <%- adAfterFAQ() %>

  <section class="ac-section">
    <h2>Related Concrete &amp; Construction Calculators</h2>
    <nav class="ac-related-grid" aria-label="Related Calculators">
      <a class="ac-rel-link" href="/construction/concrete-slab-calculator">
        <strong>Concrete Slab Calculator</strong>
        <span>Estimate ready-mix cubic yards, rebar, and poured slab costs.</span>
      </a>
      <a class="ac-rel-link" href="/construction/concrete-footing-calculator">
        <strong>Concrete Footing Calculator</strong>
        <span>Size continuous strip footings and stem walls in cubic yards.</span>
      </a>
      <a class="ac-rel-link" href="/construction/concrete-yardage-calculator">
        <strong>Concrete Yardage Calculator</strong>
        <span>Convert square feet and inches directly into ready-mix yards.</span>
      </a>
      <a class="ac-rel-link" href="/construction/cubic-yard-calculator">
        <strong>Cubic Yard Calculator</strong>
        <span>Calculate bulk volume for gravel base, sand, mulch, and fill dirt.</span>
      </a>
      <a class="ac-rel-link" href="/construction/asphalt-calculator">
        <strong>Asphalt Tonnage Calculator</strong>
        <span>Estimate hot-mix asphalt short tons with compaction allowance.</span>
      </a>
      <a class="ac-rel-link" href="/construction/stair-calculator">
        <strong>Stair Stringer Calculator</strong>
        <span>Calculate IRC-compliant step rise, run, and stringer cuts.</span>
      </a>
    </nav>
  </section>
</main>

<script>
(function () {
  var currentMode = 'slab';
  var BAG_YIELD = { 40: 0.30, 60: 0.45, 80: 0.60 };
  var PALLET_QTY = { 40: 80, 60: 56, 80: 42 };
  var WATER_GAL = { 40: 0.38, 60: 0.56, 80: 0.75 };
  var DEFAULT_PRICE = { 40: 4.10, 60: 5.15, 80: 6.47 };

  var tabs = document.querySelectorAll('.ac-tab');
  var panels = {
    slab: document.getElementById('panel-slab'),
    footing: document.getElementById('panel-footing'),
    column: document.getElementById('panel-column')
  };

  var inputs = [
    'slab-len', 'slab-wid', 'slab-depth',
    'foot-len', 'foot-wid', 'foot-depth',
    'col-dia', 'col-depth', 'col-qty',
    'bag-size', 'waste-pct', 'bag-price'
  ];

  tabs.forEach(function (tab) {
    tab.addEventListener('click', function () {
      currentMode = tab.getAttribute('data-mode');
      tabs.forEach(function (t) {
        var active = t === tab;
        t.classList.toggle('active', active);
        t.setAttribute('aria-selected', String(active));
      });
      Object.keys(panels).forEach(function (m) {
        panels[m].classList.toggle('active', m === currentMode);
      });
      calculate();
    });
  });

  document.getElementById('bag-size').addEventListener('change', function (e) {
    var sz = parseInt(e.target.value, 10);
    if (DEFAULT_PRICE[sz]) {
      document.getElementById('bag-price').value = DEFAULT_PRICE[sz].toFixed(2);
    }
    calculate();
  });

  function num(id) { return Math.max(0, parseFloat(document.getElementById(id).value) || 0); }

  function calculate() {
    var rawCuFt = 0;
    if (currentMode === 'slab') {
      rawCuFt = num('slab-len') * num('slab-wid') * (num('slab-depth') / 12);
    } else if (currentMode === 'footing') {
      rawCuFt = num('foot-len') * (num('foot-wid') / 12) * (num('foot-depth') / 12);
    } else {
      var rFt = (num('col-dia') / 2) / 12;
      var dFt = num('col-depth') / 12;
      rawCuFt = Math.PI * rFt * rFt * dFt * num('col-qty');
    }

    var wastePct = num('waste-pct');
    var totalCuFt = rawCuFt * (1 + wastePct / 100);
    var totalCuYd = totalCuFt / 27;

    var bags40 = Math.ceil(totalCuFt / BAG_YIELD[40]);
    var bags60 = Math.ceil(totalCuFt / BAG_YIELD[60]);
    var bags80 = Math.ceil(totalCuFt / BAG_YIELD[80]);

    var selectedSize = parseInt(document.getElementById('bag-size').value, 10) || 80;
    var exactSelected = Math.ceil(rawCuFt / BAG_YIELD[selectedSize]);
    var totalSelected = selectedSize === 40 ? bags40 : (selectedSize === 60 ? bags60 : bags80);
    var extraBags = Math.max(0, totalSelected - exactSelected);
    var bagPrice = num('bag-price');
    var estCost = totalSelected * bagPrice;
    var totalWeight = totalSelected * selectedSize;
    var pallets = totalSelected / PALLET_QTY[selectedSize];
    var waterGal = Math.round(totalSelected * WATER_GAL[selectedSize]);

    document.getElementById('out-primary-lbl').textContent = selectedSize + ' lb Concrete Bags Needed';
    document.getElementById('out-primary-bags').textContent = totalSelected.toLocaleString('en-US') + ' Bags';
    document.getElementById('out-primary-sub').textContent =
      wastePct > 0
        ? 'Includes ' + wastePct + '% waste (' + exactSelected + ' exact + ' + extraBags + ' extra)'
        : 'Exact geometric volume (0% waste buffer)';

    document.getElementById('out-40').textContent = bags40.toLocaleString('en-US');
    document.getElementById('out-60').textContent = bags60.toLocaleString('en-US');
    document.getElementById('out-80').textContent = bags80.toLocaleString('en-US');

    [40, 60, 80].forEach(function (sz) {
      document.getElementById('card-' + sz).classList.toggle('selected', sz === selectedSize);
    });

    document.getElementById('out-yd').textContent = totalCuYd.toFixed(2) + ' cu yd';
    document.getElementById('out-ft').textContent = totalCuFt.toFixed(2) + ' cu ft total';
    document.getElementById('out-cost').textContent = '$' + Math.round(estCost).toLocaleString('en-US');
    document.getElementById('out-weight').textContent = totalWeight.toLocaleString('en-US') + ' lbs dry weight';
    document.getElementById('out-pallets').textContent = pallets.toFixed(2) + ' pallets';
    document.getElementById('out-pallet-note').textContent = PALLET_QTY[selectedSize] + ' bags per ' + selectedSize + ' lb pallet';
    document.getElementById('out-water').textContent = '~' + waterGal.toLocaleString('en-US') + ' gal';

    var alertBox = document.getElementById('out-truck-alert');
    if (totalCuYd >= 1.5) {
      alertBox.style.background = '#fffbeb';
      alertBox.style.borderColor = '#fcd34d';
      alertBox.style.borderLeftColor = '#d97706';
      alertBox.style.color = '#78350f';
      alertBox.innerHTML = '<strong>Ready-Mix Truck Crossover (' + totalCuYd.toFixed(2) + ' cu yd):</strong> Above 1.5 cubic yards (~68+ eighty-pound bags), ordering a ready-mix concrete truck ($150–$195/yd + short-load fee) usually beats hand-mixing on both labor time and slab consistency.';
    } else {
      alertBox.style.background = '#f0fdf4';
      alertBox.style.borderColor = '#bbf7d0';
      alertBox.style.borderLeftColor = '#16a34a';
      alertBox.style.color = '#14532d';
      alertBox.innerHTML = '<strong>Bag-Mix Sweet Spot (' + totalCuYd.toFixed(2) + ' cu yd):</strong> Under 1.5 cubic yards, bagged concrete avoids ready-mix short-load delivery minimums ($100–$175) and lets you pour at your own pace.';
    }
  }

  inputs.forEach(function (id) {
    var el = document.getElementById(id);
    if (el) {
      el.addEventListener('input', calculate);
      el.addEventListener('change', calculate);
    }
  });
  document.getElementById('cb-calc-btn').addEventListener('click', calculate);
  document.getElementById('cb-reset-btn').addEventListener('click', function () {
    document.getElementById('slab-len').value = 10;
    document.getElementById('slab-wid').value = 12;
    document.getElementById('slab-depth').value = 4;
    document.getElementById('foot-len').value = 30;
    document.getElementById('foot-wid').value = 16;
    document.getElementById('foot-depth').value = 8;
    document.getElementById('col-dia').value = 12;
    document.getElementById('col-depth').value = 36;
    document.getElementById('col-qty').value = 8;
    document.getElementById('bag-size').value = '80';
    document.getElementById('waste-pct').value = '10';
    document.getElementById('bag-price').value = '6.47';
    currentMode = 'slab';
    tabs.forEach(function (t) {
      var active = t.getAttribute('data-mode') === 'slab';
      t.classList.toggle('active', active);
      t.setAttribute('aria-selected', String(active));
    });
    Object.keys(panels).forEach(function (m) {
      panels[m].classList.toggle('active', m === 'slab');
    });
    calculate();
  });

  calculate();
})();
</script>

<%- include('../../partials/footer') %>
